9
00:00:50.643 --> 00:00:52.276
There's also a living room,

10
00:00:52.309 --> 00:00:54.679
slash, sitting room over there.

11
00:00:54.712 --> 00:00:55.947
- Okay.
- Yeah.

12
00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.881
